# The black-frame experiment: fx-org1 with DXVK's command list closed right after each in-stream epoch (CS_ORG_STREAM_FLUSH_AFTER).
# Correct shots: state the epoch leaves in DXVK's command buffer. Still black: a memory, layout or ordering fault.
CS_ORG_FX=1
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;602:fw 81a;700:coc Whiterun;2000:fw 81a;2400:dclf:shot=whiterun;2500:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;3600:dclf:shot=dragonsreach
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3700
CS_ORG_STREAM_FLUSH_AFTER=1
